  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Divine Emperor City, Genesis Lotus’ will is solemn as he activates a method he has prepared for a long while. Fang Yuan’s portrait appears in Divine Emperor City’s painting world, standing in front of Genesis Lotus’ will, motionless, with eyes closed.",
