        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Genesis Lotus Immortal Venerable already created scenic portrait. Star Constellation Immortal Venerable worked together with Genesis Lotus’ will to modify it, targeting Fang Yuan’s reverse flow protection seal. Fang Yuan is hit by scenic portrait. Reverse Flow River can essentially reflect everything, but reverse flow protection seal was created by Fang Yuan. Fang Yuan has almost no understanding of painting path, his attainment level in it is blank, so painting path methods were effective on him.",
